    (237::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait','Concert sell-outs and named club nights create the real queue; an ordinary early evening does not. Buy the event ticket first, arrive near doors for headline shows and expect bag and age checks. The venue sits beneath Ehrenfeld station, so allow extra time to find the correct entrance.','best_nights','Pick the bill, not a generic weekday. Live concerts, hip-hop, indie, global sounds and electronic parties all use the room, with Friday and Saturday club dates running latest. A queer-themed booking can be excellent, but the venue itself is a broad cultural club rather than a weekly gay night.','crowd_mix','Ehrenfeld students, music devotees, young professionals and international visitors follow the artist or promoter. Queer guests are a normal part of the mix, especially at explicitly inclusive parties, but no fixed LGBTQ+ house crowd is promised. Expect the audience to change sharply from event to event.','dress_code','There is no published fashion code beyond safe, event-appropriate clothing. Trainers, denim and expressive clubwear fit most bills; leave bulky bags behind and dress lightly for a packed floor. A kinky or themed promoter may publish separate guidance, so read the event page before setting out.','staff_inclusivity','The club publishes visit information and hosts diverse cultural and queer-friendly programming, while reviews vary around door handling, heat and crowding. Staff support is most dependable when guests know the ticket terms and event rules. Raise accessibility or discrimination concerns with the venue team promptly.','venue_classification','active_mainstream_ehrenfeld_live_music_and_club_venue_beneath_station_with_event_led_queues_eclectic_concert_electronic_hiphop_and_queer_friendly_programming_audience_defined_by_promoter_and_mixed_door_heat_consensus','identity_note','Club Bahnhof Ehrenfeld is a general live-music and nightlife venue that sometimes hosts explicitly queer or inclusive events; it is not a dedicated LGBTQ+ club.','source_urls',to_jsonb(array['https://www.clubbahnhofehrenfeld.de/','https://www.clubbahnhofehrenfeld.de/info/besuch','https://www.clubbahnhofehrenfeld.de/programm','https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g187371-d5537295-Reviews-Club_Bahnhof_Ehrenfeld-Cologne_North_Rhine_Westphalia.html']::text[]),
