    (1828::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait','There is no door or queue: this is a small public green space in Nippes, not a bar, club or staffed attraction. Use daylight street access and normal park awareness. Do not travel expecting admission, service, toilets or a programmed LGBTQ+ gathering unless a current organiser names one.','best_nights','No recurring nightlife programme is verified. The sensible visit is by day for a pause or walk through the neighbourhood; after dark it is simply an urban green space. For queer social plans, choose a named venue or announced event elsewhere rather than treating this map label as a destination.','crowd_mix','Residents, walkers, families and passers-by use the surrounding public space. There is no managed house crowd and no evidence of a dedicated queer audience. Any gathering would belong to its organiser, not to Cranachwäldchen itself, so atmosphere and access cannot be generalised.','dress_code','Wear weather-ready everyday clothes and shoes for a park path. There is no dress policy, cloakroom or controlled entrance. Keep valuables ordinary and discreet after dark, respect neighbours and leave event-specific outfits for a confirmed venue with facilities.','staff_inclusivity','No staff, security team or hospitality service exists to assess. Cologne and Nippes are broadly queer-friendly contexts, but that is not a venue-level safeguard. Meet at a precise public point, share plans with friends and use city services if help is needed.','venue_classification','public_neighbourhood_green_space_landmark_in_cologne_nippes_without_managed_admission_staff_hospitality_programming_or_verified_lgbtq_venue_function','record_status','invalid_venue_type_public_green_space_not_managed_hospitality_or_lgbtq_destination_hide_from_venue_search_maps_sitemap_city_counts_and_intelligence_scoring','identity_note','Cranachwäldchen is a public green-space name in Nippes, not a hospitality business or operated LGBTQ+ venue.','source_urls',to_jsonb(array['https://www.stadt-koeln.de/leben-in-koeln/freizeit-natur-sport/parks/','https://www.koeln.de/apps/strassen/cranachstr','https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nippes_%28K%C3%B6ln%29']::text[]),
