    (243::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait','The identifiable Deck5 is a seasonal rooftop beach bar in Berlin, not Cologne. Sunset and warm-weather dates can fill, with group seating generally reserved only for larger parties. Do not use this record for a Cologne visit; verify the Berlin opening notice and weather before travelling.','best_nights','In Berlin, clear summer evenings and sunset are the draw, while rain or cold can change service. The venue also takes private functions. There is no verified Cologne programme attached to this record, so it should not appear in Cologne nightlife recommendations.','crowd_mix','The Berlin rooftop attracts mainstream local groups, couples, tourists and private-event guests. It is not presented as a dedicated queer bar, though LGBTQ+ visitors may be part of the general city crowd. No credible crowd evidence connects this identity with Cologne.','dress_code','Casual summer rooftop clothing and a layer for wind suit the Berlin venue; footwear must handle a rooftop and shopping-centre approach. There is no verified queer or Cologne dress policy. The geographic mismatch matters more than styling advice.','staff_inclusivity','The official operator describes a professional event and hospitality team, but no property-specific LGBTQ+ programme was found. Review-level welcome cannot repair the record’s city error. Assess the Berlin venue on its own listing and remove this version from Cologne results.','venue_classification','active_seasonal_mainstream_berlin_rooftop_beach_bar_on_schoenhauser_allee_arcaden_with_sunset_cocktails_food_group_and_private_events_but_no_verified_cologne_identity','record_status','wrong_city_entity_mismatch_identifiable_deck5_is_in_berlin_not_cologne_hide_from_venue_search_maps_sitemap_city_counts_and_intelligence_scoring_until_record_is_relocated_or_reidentified','identity_note','The current official Deck5 is Berlin’s rooftop beach bar. No matching Cologne venue was verified, so the stored record is geographically invalid.','source_urls',to_jsonb(array['https://www.deck-5.com/de/','https://www.deck-5.com/en/beach-bar/','https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g187323-d10069770-Reviews-Deck5_Berlin-Berlin.html']::text[]),
