    (236::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait','Early drinks are easy, but the tiny room compresses quickly after the Friday and Saturday DJ starts around 23:00; busy nights spill toward the street. Tuesday karaoke also draws a crowd. Use the central weekend cloakroom, keep the doorway clear and expect slower bar access at peak.','best_nights','Tuesday karaoke is the playful weeknight signature. Friday, Saturday and pre-holiday nights deliver the full pop, dance and singalong party into morning; earlier daily hours suit Kölsch and conversation. Pride, Carnival and themed dates intensify everything, so check the current post.','crowd_mix','Younger gay men and regulars form the visible core, with lesbians, trans people, queer friends, straight companions and visitors also appearing. The social mix broadens on big dates, yet reviews show that some women and trans guests have felt singled out; do not mistake popularity for uniform welcome.','dress_code','Casual, colourful and ready to dance works: trainers, tees, denim and playful themed looks all fit. There is no published formal code. The room gets close and warm, so travel light; the central cloakroom helps on weekends, but keep your claim ticket secure.','staff_inclusivity','Many guests praise warm bartenders, easy conversation and a friendly regular network. A meaningful minority report hostile security, gendered treatment, racism or unexplained removal. That split must remain visible: agree charges, stay with friends and document concerns rather than assuming every shift behaves alike.','venue_classification','active_small_high_energy_gay_bar_on_schaafenstrasse_with_daily_early_drinks_tuesday_karaoke_weekend_pop_djs_young_gay_core_broad_visitors_and_sharply_mixed_security_gender_race_inclusivity_consensus','identity_note','Die Mumu is a prominent gay party bar, but current reviews contain serious and recurring inclusion complaints alongside strong praise; it should not be framed as universally safe.','source_urls',to_jsonb(array['https://die-mumu.de/','https://www.travelgay.com/venue/die-mumu','https://wanderlog.com/place/details/452552/die-mumu','https://www.koelntourismus.de/kunst-kultur/sehenswuerdigkeiten/detail/schaafenstrasse']::text[]),
