    (1826::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait','Hostel check-in runs 15:00–22:00, so late arrivals must arrange access rather than assume a night desk. The ground-floor bar and 70-seat theatre can fill for DJs or ticketed events, but hostel guests use a separate upstairs setting. Book beds ahead for weekends and major fairs.','best_nights','Choose an announced concert, reading, film or theatre date if culture matters; the café-bar becomes more social with rotating evening DJs. A quiet weekday better suits sleep and the 24-hour guest lounge. Cologne Pride and trade-fair weekends raise demand, while the neighbourhood supplies nightlife every night.','crowd_mix','Solo travellers, backpackers, creative visitors and small groups mix with Cologne locals in the public bar and theatre. The hostel is adult-only for unaccompanied guests and strongly social without being a party dorm. Queer guests fit naturally into the Belgian Quarter’s broad, international crowd.','dress_code','Everyday creative casual fits the hostel, café-bar and theatre. There is no fashion gate; pack secure indoor shoes and a light layer because rooms can be warm and shared bathrooms sit in the corridor. Use the curtain and keyed locker rather than leaving valuables around a dorm.','staff_inclusivity','Thousands of hostel reviews rate the team exceptionally highly for friendliness, recommendations, safety and practical help. No dedicated LGBTQ+ training statement surfaced, so the evidence supports excellent general inclusion, not a specialised queer service claim. Ask reception about privacy or access needs.','venue_classification','active_design_hostel_cafe_bar_and_seventy_seat_cultural_theatre_in_cologne_belgian_quarter_with_large_privacy_beds_social_solo_traveller_mix_rotating_djs_and_exceptionally_strong_staff_cleanliness_safety_consensus','identity_note','Die Wohngemeinschaft is a mainstream but highly social design hostel with a public café-bar and theatre, not an LGBTQ+-specific property.','source_urls',to_jsonb(array['https://www.die-wohngemeinschaft.net/','https://www.hostelworld.com/hostels/p/44622/die-wohngemeinschaft/','https://www.booking.com/hotel/de/hostel-die-wohngemeinschaft.en-gb.html','https://www.tripadvisor.de/Hotel_Review-g187371-d1954561-Reviews-Hostel_die_wohngemeinschaft-Cologne_North_Rhine_Westphalia.html']::text[]),
