    (239::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait','This is a scheduled Sunday after-hours event, not a daily club. The door can build when the host venue opens after a major Saturday night, and popular editions sell advance tickets. Check the exact date, venue and entry terms; arriving in the first hour can reduce uncertainty and often includes a drink.','best_nights','Only announced Sundays matter. The long-running series pairs progressive house and trance with international and Cologne DJs, often after a major weekend or festival. It is strongest as the continuation of Saturday night, not as a casual Sunday bar; consult the live calendar before planning.','crowd_mix','Gay men remain central to the after-hours tradition, joined by queer clubbers, allies, travelling circuit fans and committed electronic-music regulars. The crowd is adult, international and dance-led. Individual editions can skew by the preceding event, DJ and Pride or Carnival calendar.','dress_code','Sporty circuit wear, club basics and expressive dance looks fit; there is no reliable formal code published across every host date. Dress for a long, warm session, carry official ID and travel light. The host venue’s rules override assumptions based on the Green Komm brand.','staff_inclusivity','The event’s decades-long queer after-hours identity is substantial, and reviews praise the friendly crowd and organisation. Door and service experience still belongs partly to the host venue and individual edition. Use the published contact, understand re-entry and ticket conditions, and seek staff early if unsafe.','venue_classification','active_long_running_cologne_gay_and_queer_sunday_afterhours_event_series_since_1993_with_progressive_house_trance_international_djs_circuit_crowd_rotating_dates_and_host_venue_specific_door_rules','identity_note','Green Komm is a recurring queer Sunday after-hours party brand, not a continuously open venue. Its current date and host location must be verified for every visit.','source_urls',to_jsonb(array['https://www.greenkomm.com/','https://www.greenkomm.com/events/','https://de.restaurantguru.com/GreenKomm-Cologne','https://www.facebook.com/GreenKomm/']::text[]),
